      "user_view_type": "public",
      "site_admin": false
    },
    "body": "This attribute should also be in IDL.\r\n\r\nI'm a bit less concerned about serialization, in particular about combinations you would only be able to end up with after performing tree mutations, such as a global registry child of a custom registry parent. I also don't want to go into the complexity of supporting values at this time as that would also raise questions for the equivalent declarative shadow root attribute.\r\n\r\nThe one bit of complexity is perhaps that we don't want to add the attribute redundantly I think. If we already serialized it for an ancestor there's no need to serialize it again.",
